#: diagnosticPrefs.js:28
msgid ""
"Clipboard diagnostic: when pasting fails, run this before copying again. "
"Records the available formats, retrieval results and text, and the text at "
"the top of history. Does not change the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"クリップボード診断：貼り付けに問題が起きたら、コピーし直す前に実行してくださ"
"い。現在の形式・取得結果・本文と、履歴先頭の本文を区別して記録します。クリッ"
"プボードの内容は変更しません。"

#: diagnosticPrefs.js:37
msgid ""
"Records may contain passwords or personal information. They are saved "
